              description="Three-axis motion control, CSP architecture (Cyclic Synchronous Position). Layer 1: INTERP FB (interpolation engine) — trapezoidal trajectory planner in the PLC, outputs one position setpoint per scan. Layer 2: DRIVE402 FB (drive model) — receives cyclic position setpoints, closes position loop (P + setpoint-rate feedforward), CiA 402 state machine, velocity output to motor. Layer 3: MC_Power/MC_Reset/MC_MoveAbsolute/MC_MoveJog/MC_Stop/MC_Home API. PLC only plans and streams setpoints; the drive does the loops." />
